{
  "schemaVersion": "story-package-world-module/0.1",
  "package": {
    "id": "novel-918fd8656c43a65b0bab33a4099a4a556b29a847db7f97f6d54b0a15f7f924a8",
    "version": "0.1.0"
  },
  "metadata": {
    "title": "雨夜候车室",
    "summary": "临潮站的电子钟停在二十三点十分。；候车厅的玻璃门外，雨被海风推成斜线，扑在站台的黄灯上。",
    "authoringSource": "source_text_script",
    "contentRating": "unspecified",
    "language": "zh-CN",
    "chapterHeadingStyle": "chinese_dunhao"
  },
  "world": {
    "premise": "临潮站的电子钟停在二十三点十分。；候车厅的玻璃门外，雨被海风推成斜线，扑在站台的黄灯上。",
    "immutableFacts": [
      {
        "id": "fact_3c3addc34bfb",
        "text": "临潮站的电子钟停在二十三点十分。",
        "sourceChapterId": "chapter-001",
        "sourceProgress": "chapter_001",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5,
          "end": 5
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "fact_997344d1bae5",
        "text": "末班列车停在那里，车窗里一排排空座位浮在湿漉漉的夜色中，车门紧闭，像一条没有开口的鱼。",
        "sourceChapterId": "chapter-001",
        "sourceProgress": "chapter_001",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 7,
          "end": 7
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "fact_596eb647b7d3",
        "text": "语音的发送时间是二十二点五十五分。",
        "sourceChapterId": "chapter-001",
        "sourceProgress": "chapter_001",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 17,
          "end": 17
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "fact_85bf99de76e9",
        "text": "十五分钟后，许川赶到临潮站，唐栖的电话已经无法接通。",
        "sourceChapterId": "chapter-001",
        "sourceProgress": "chapter_001",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 17,
          "end": 17
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "fact_31b06bac8110",
        "text": "候车厅的红色电子钟仍停在二十三点十分，像在替所有人保守一个即将被冲开的秘密。",
        "sourceChapterId": "chapter-001",
        "sourceProgress": "chapter_003",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 107,
          "end": 107
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "fact_d276971701e8",
        "text": "别让陈砚拿到储物柜里的录音。隧道里还有人。",
        "sourceChapterId": "chapter-001",
        "sourceProgress": "chapter_001",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 13,
          "end": 13
        },
        "communication": {
          "speakerName": "唐栖",
          "kind": "语音"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "fact_18f95085f3b7",
        "text": "调度台上的屏幕亮着，画面停在列车放行记录。",
        "sourceChapterId": "chapter-002",
        "sourceProgress": "chapter_005",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 119,
          "end": 119
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "fact_16fdc2792917",
        "text": "记录页上，二十三点四十七分的检修申请被标记为“已完成”，可屏幕右下角的设备状态却显示：信号室排水泵故障，备用电池剩余四十五分钟。",
        "sourceChapterId": "chapter-002",
        "sourceProgress": "chapter_005",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 155,
          "end": 155
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "fact_fe0ebb6a9278",
        "text": "里面没有黑暗，远处有一盏红色故障灯一闪一闪，把积水照得像浑浊的血。",
        "sourceChapterId": "chapter-003",
        "sourceProgress": "chapter_008",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 231,
          "end": 231
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "fact_c4d45f714b4e",
        "text": "他知道排水泵撑不到这个雨季，却还把故障写成‘已排除’。",
        "sourceChapterId": "chapter-003",
        "sourceProgress": "chapter_009",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 237,
          "end": 237
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "fact_eb2a65fe10d2",
        "text": "图纸上那条备用排水沟被碎石堵住了，如果不先开阀，水会继续往信号室倒灌。",
        "sourceChapterId": "chapter-003",
        "sourceProgress": "chapter_009",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 249,
          "end": 249
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "fact_012dfc6a9412",
        "text": "一下，两下，第三下时，金属终于断开。",
        "sourceChapterId": "chapter-003",
        "sourceProgress": "chapter_010",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 329,
          "end": 329
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "fact_6fe681c0ad83",
        "text": "暴雨切断了站内的普通通信，列车却必须保留一条故障上报通道。",
        "sourceChapterId": "chapter-004",
        "sourceProgress": "chapter_013",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 389,
          "end": 389
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "fact_b963aaf152a7",
        "text": "他没有再坐回墙角，而是在调度台前写下第一行：二十三点四十七分，信号室排水泵故障，未完成维修。",
        "sourceChapterId": "chapter-004",
        "sourceProgress": "chapter_014",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 409,
          "end": 409
        }
      }
    ],
